- Handles more: Remove unused vars (Python: pyflakes + Rope; Rust: clippy), fix broad except (add specific), optimize loops (add @lru_cache or #[inline])
- AI-like heuristics for fixes (prioritize high-severity)
- --autofix applies; --dry-run shows diff
- Fixed issues tracked in metrics/report
Dependencies: pip install rope black autopep8 pyflakes; Rust toolchain + clippy
"""

